# W4d, a (k5): the gate to stag0101 at @120; the gate form lists k's row; autochoice new with its Public default at once:
# its barrier comes first. It plays alone (b never arrives in its stage group).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1800 fail present>=2
log a alone
idle until frames>=60
